  "stem": "A 6-year-old girl is behind with her schoolwork and does not appear to be listening in class. She tends to sit on her own and brings toys to school to play with at break times instead of socialising. She is pleasant but appears to ignore people.\n\nWhich one of the following should be done first?",
  "questionType": "SBA",
  "options": [
