      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "explanation": "Hearing impairment can present as apparent inattention, poor school performance, and social withdrawal because the child may not be hearing instructions or conversation properly. A hearing test is an important first step before pursuing neurodevelopmental diagnoses.",
